Institutional mechanisms for receiving grievances at the Village Panchayat, Block and District levels, with at least one designated day each week when officials shall be mandatorily available to receive grievances;

Every worker shall have an opportunity of being heard and register any grievance either orally or in writing, at all implementation levels for disposal as per the provisions of the Grievance Redressal Mechanism under the Scheme.

Issuance of a dated acknowledgement for all grievances submitted in writing, telephonically, online, or orally to any authorized functionary;

Enquiry through spot verification or inspection and disposal shall be completed within seven working days of receipt of the grievance;

Upon completion of the enquiry, the concerned authority shall initiate immediate corrective action, and the grievance shall be

resolved within fifteen days;

